Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.23,0:23:16.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur6}你悄悄地松开了手臂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.70,0:23:20.74,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur6}其实我们早已分离
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.61,0:23:25.95,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur6}不要撕裂彼此
